      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 40,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "Be pleased, LORD, to deliver me. Hurry to help me, LORD.",
      "ko": "여호와여 은총을 베푸사 나를 구원하소서 여호와여 속히 나를 도우소서",
      "source_text_hash": "b6786378cb5e3ba1a684b15b34334f6800892f3eb680728b7c17fcbef8fb76c0",
      "translation_text_hash": "c4ef8a90434ad11cb5d3438e2b33a21f31529264e7ac53a678f448aff0d66f2c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와여 은총을 베푸사 나를 구원하소서 여호와여 속히 나를 도우소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c4ef8a90434ad11cb5d3438e2b33a21f31529264e7ac53a678f448aff0d66f2c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:40:14",
      "sequence": 14540,
